# VI: Mở file này trong VS Code (extension REST Client) hoặc Visual Studio / Rider để gọi thử API.
# EN: Open in VS Code (REST Client extension), Visual Studio or Rider to try the API.

@base = http://localhost:5080/api

### Đăng ký / Register
# @name register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "testuser", "email": "testuser@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### Đăng nhập / Login
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usernameOrEmail": "testuser", "password": "password123" }

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Hồ sơ / Profile
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tạo deadline có giờ / Timed deadline block
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Nộp bài Web", "startAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:00+07:00", "endAt": "2026-10-24T16:00:00+07:00", "color": "#ff6b6b", "priority": "High" }

### Tạo sự kiện cả ngày / All-day event
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Tuần thi", "startAt": "2026-11-09", "endAt": "2026-11-13", "isAllDay": true }

### Lịch tháng / Month calendar
GET {{base}}/tasks/calendar?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sắp tới hạn / Upcoming
GET {{base}}/tasks/upcoming?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ghi một phiên Pomodoro / Log a focus session
POST {{base}}/focus-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "Work", "startedAt": "2026-10-23T02:00:00Z", "endedAt": "2026-10-23T02:25:00Z" }

### Thống kê 7 ngày / 7-day stats
GET {{base}}/stats/summary?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Đổi link nhạc thành embed / Resolve a music link
POST {{base}}/music/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://open.spotify.com/track/4uLU6hMCjMI75M1A2tKUQC" }

### Playlists
GET {{base}}/playlists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
